a\u2019s hometown and beyond, talk to residents (alive and dead!), complete side-quests, and delve deeper into DreadOut lore<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore sleepy Lil' town, night and day to solve terrifying urban legends that haunt within.</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945710/extras/bcc7d124039654a3b9e6a396a7af0762.poster.avif?t=1726041626\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945710/extras/bcc7d124039654a3b9e6a396a7af0762.webm?t=1726041626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945710/extras/bcc7d124039654a3b9e6a396a7af0762.mp4?t=1726041626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Interact with various unique NPCs both human and ghosts, with various locations teeming with their antics.</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945710/extras/72c86802def4b772efd90b89361bb21e.poster.avif?t=1726041626\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945710/extras/72c86802def4b772efd90b89361bb21e.webm?t=1726041626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945710/extras/72c86802def4b772efd90b89361bb21e.mp4?t=1726041626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Considerable amount of side quests, hidden stages, and mini-bosses written specifically based on our Asian/Indonesian urban legends.</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945710/extras/6a501302a804898a02d0b35bce3f061e.poster.avif?t=1726041626\" ><source s