    "reviews": "\u201cThe best game you missed in February 2020: DreadOut 2\u201d<br>Rock paper shotgun<br><br>\u201cIt\u2019s a charming and generally enjoyable action-adventure romp with ghosts, monsters, atmospheric locations and different types of gameplay mechanics that add up to a satisfying overall package.\u201d<br>gtogg<br><br>\u201cDreadOut 2 is a game made with much more passion and attention to detail than many other comparable titles and you can see that in every corner. In the end, DreadOut2\u2019s problems are probably due to an insufficient budget.\u201d<br>virtualseasia<br>",
